  "details": "1. Go to https://www.discovervr.chat/spookality\n\n2. Sign in with VRChat\n\n3. It shows \"Signed in as Kazy\"\n\n4. Input my email\n\n5. Click \"Get Link\"\n\nIt then signs me back out, saying my  VRChat sign-in expired.\n\nFor what it's worth, I'm an old user with a legacy 10-character userID.\n\nThough opening up the console seems to show a 401 error on the GET request to the API.\n\nHappens over different browsers, different devices, and even different networks.",
